<%= cw.relative_time_for datetime: datetime, threshold: threshold do |rt| %>
  <p>
    Posted
    <time <%= cw_attrs(rt.root_attrs) %>><%= time_ago_in_words(Time.iso8601(datetime)) %> ago</time>
  </p>
<% end %>

<p>
  Hover the timestamp, or read its <code>title</code> attribute with a screen reader — both
  carry the exact absolute instant. There is deliberately no <code>aria-live</code> here:
  this element re-renders its own text every few seconds, and announcing that on every
  change would be a screen-reader denial-of-service, not a convenience.
</p>
